  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"321\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"321\">About Our Brand &amp; Products</strong></h3><p data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"594\">The Mum Brand was built by real moms who got tired (literally) of feeling overworked, overstimulated, and overlooked.<br data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"442\">We create <strong data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"518\">science-backed wellness products made specifically for mothers</strong> - products that actually work for real, everyday energy, focus, and calm.</p><p data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"799\">Our first hero product, <strong data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"631\">MumFuel</strong>, is an energy + focus supplement designed for tired, brain-fogged moms who are ready to feel like themselves again - without the caffeine crash, guilt, or fake hype.</p><p data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"983\">We work closely with nutrition experts and scientists to use only premium, proven ingredients that support focus, energy, and mood - so moms can show up as their best selves again.</p><hr data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"988\"><h3 data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1023\">⚡ <strong data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1023\">What Makes Us Different</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1542\"><li data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1148\"><p data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1148\"><strong data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1054\">Built for moms, by moms.</strong> We understand the mental load, sensory overload, and constant fatigue - because we live it.</p></li><li data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1291\"><p data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1291\"><strong data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1179\">Formulated with experts.</strong> Every ingredient in MumFuel was chosen by professionals who understand women’s health and cognitive wellness.</p></li><li data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1417\"><p data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1417\"><strong data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1322\">Clean, effective, no-BS.</strong> No sketchy stimulants. No filler ingredients. Just smart, steady energy that actually lasts.</p></li><li data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1542\"><p data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1542\"><strong data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1446\">Real, raw brand voice.</strong> We’re not another “wellness” brand pretending motherhood is all rainbows. We speak mom-truth.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1547\"><h3 data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1583\">💰 <strong data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1583\">How Affiliates Can Earn</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1926\"><li data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1649\"><p data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1649\"><strong data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1601\">Commission:</strong> 25%</p></li><li data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1833\"><p data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1833\"><strong data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1741\">Bonuses:</strong> We reward top performers with extra cash, free product, and early access to new launches.</p></li><li data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1926\"><p data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1926\"><strong data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1858\">30 Day Tracking:</strong> Once a customer clicks your link, they’re connected to you for 30 days.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"1998\"><h3 data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2028\">📣 <strong data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2028\">How to Promote Us</strong></h3><p data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2169\">We’re looking for creators and affiliates who <em data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2080\">get</em> mom life - the chaos, the humor, the brain fog, the burnout, and the beauty of it all.</p><p data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2193\">Ideas for promotion:</p><ul data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2600\"><li data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2298\"><p data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2298\"><strong data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2211\">UGC videos:</strong> “Coffee isn’t cutting it anymore” → show your real-life transformation with MumFuel.</p></li><li data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2406\"><p data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2406\"><strong data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2337\">Before &amp; after energy check-ins:</strong> Film yourself in your real environment (kitchen, car, school run).</p></li><li data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2514\"><p data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2514\"><strong data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2432\">Storytelling posts:</strong> Share your #tiredmom truth and how MumFuel helps you feel like <em data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2505\">you</em> again.</p></li><li data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2600\"><p data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2600\"><strong data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2537\">Reviews + Reels:</strong> Show mixing, sipping, and the mood/energy shift in your day.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2690\">We love authentic, unfiltered voices - no stiff product reviews. Moms trust real moms.</p><hr data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2695\"><h3 data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2725\">🧠 <strong data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2725\">Other Information</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"3060\"><li data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2754\"><p data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2754\">Brand: <strong data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2752\">The Mum Brand</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2816\"><p data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2816\">Product: <strong data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2814\">MumFuel: Energy and Wellness For Busy Moms</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2859\"><p data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2859\">Website: themumbrand.com/products/mum-fuel</p></li><li data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"2918\"><p data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2918\">Email for collabs/support: <strong>contact</strong><strong data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2916\"><a data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2914\" class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@themumbrand.com</a></strong></p></li></ul></div></div>",
